<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-what-to-serve-with-caprese-grilled-chicken">What to Serve With Caprese Grilled Chicken?</h2>



<p>This grilled mozzarella chicken is one of those mains that goes with just about everything. It&rsquo;s light but still filling, and that fresh tomato-basil topping makes it easy to pair with all kinds of sides. Here are a few of my favorite pairings:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>With fresh green salads:</strong> You can&rsquo;t go wrong with a crisp salad. My <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/spring-mix-salad/">Spring Mix Salad</a> adds a pop of color and has a tangy dressing, while my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/butter-lettuce-salad/">Butter Lettuce Salad</a> is light, fresh, and goes perfectly with the chicken.</li>



<li><strong>Alongside roasted vegetables:</strong> When I want an easy dinner side, roasted veggies are my go-to. My <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/eggplant-involtini-2/">Eggplant Involtini</a> is rich and cheesy, and my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/crispy-baked-eggplant/">Baked Breaded Eggplant</a> has the best crunch.</li>



<li><strong>With pasta:</strong> For a more filling dinner,pair it with something creamy or buttery. My <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/lemon-ricotta-pasta/">Lemon Ricotta Pasta</a> keeps things bright, while my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/garlic-butter-pasta/">Garlic Butter Pasta</a> is cozy and comforting.</li>



<li><strong>With warm bread:</strong> A side of my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/air-fryer-garlic-bread/">Garlic Bread&nbsp;in the Air Fryer</a> or <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/olive-bread-recipe/">Olive Bread</a> is perfect for soaking up every drop of tomato-basil juice.</li>



<li><strong>Over grains:</strong> Serve it over a bed of <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/vermicelli-rice/">Vermicelli Rice</a> or <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/lemon-quinoa/">Lemon Quinoa</a> to make it a complete, satisfying meal that also captures those flavorful juices.</li>
</ul>



